  "interior": {
    "art": "/art/station_int.svg",
    "title": "Old Town Precinct -- the bullpen",
    "ambientCaption": "[typewriters, a kettle somewhere, rain against the glass]",
    "firstEntry": {
      "flag": "seen:interior",
      "lines": [
        "The bullpen smells of rain, typewriter ribbon, and somebody's burnt toast.",
        "Fourteen desks, eleven of them occupied. The one by the radiator has a new name-plate -- E. BYRNE -- and the brass is still bright enough to catch the lamplight.",
        "The chair behind it is ugly and worn on the left arm, where somebody leaned for years. It does not know you yet. It will.",
        "On the desk: a blotter, a half tin of pencils, and four folders that are not yours -- plus, since this morning, one that is."
      ]
    },
